        },
        {
            "title": "國際｜現代第五代Tucson改走硬朗風 混能版目標油耗17.9公里",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"國際｜現代第五代Tucson改走硬朗風 混能版目標油耗17.9公里\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"502\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c460bdd15af209a9761bf73d53273a284636b311b82e2c7142b9da3e93fc486b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb.png\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">國際｜現代第五代Tucson改走硬朗風 混能版目標油耗17.9公里</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">現代汽車發布第五代Tucson，新車由流線造型改為方正硬朗風格，並升級混能系統、車廂及智能配備。北美兩驅混能版目標油耗約每公升17.9公里，插電式混能版純電續航81公里。長軸距版車長4.7米，軸距2.785米。新車在紐約全球首發，預計2027年起陸續進入歐洲及其他市場。</p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E5%9C%8B%E9%9A%9B-%E7%8F%BE%E4%BB%A3%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%94%E4%BB%A3tucson%E6%94%B9%E8%B5%B0%E7%A1%AC%E6%9C%97%E9%A2%A8-%E6%B7%B7%E8%83%BD%E7%89%88%E7%9B%AE%E6%A8%99%E6%B2%B9%E8%80%9717-9%E5%85%AC%E9%87%8C-170031027.html",
